This game uses the following libraries, linked into the executable.

FFmpeg 9.0.2
  License: GNU Lesser General Public License version 2.1 or later (ffmpeg-LICENSE.txt).
  Built without GPL or nonfree components, with only the bink, wav and mp3
  demuxers and the bink, binkaudio_dct, pcm_s16le, adpcm_ima_wav and mp3float
  decoders enabled (see cmake/ports/ffmpeg in the game's source).
  Source: https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-9.0.2.tar.xz

OpenAL Soft 1.25.2
  License: GNU Library General Public License version 2 (openal-soft-LICENSE.txt),
  with the bundled PFFFT under its own license (openal-soft-pffft-LICENSE.txt).
  Built with the float sample loading change in
  cmake/ports/openal-soft/0001-float-loader.patch in the game's source.
  Source: https://github.com/kcat/openal-soft/releases/tag/1.25.2

The game's own source code, including the build scripts above, is available
under the GNU General Public License version 3.

This executable was built from @NOTICE_SOURCE_REVISION@
of @NOTICE_SOURCE_URL@
The build uses the vcpkg ports in cmake/ports and the vcpkg baseline in
vcpkg.json of that revision. Building that revision with a modified FFmpeg or
OpenAL Soft port produces the game linked against the modified library.

The release that ships this executable also publishes a source archive next to
the game download, with the same name followed by -sources. It holds the exact
FFmpeg and OpenAL Soft source archives used for the build and the ports above.
